.DS_Store

# clasp. .clasprc.json holds an OAuth token for your Google account -- it is a
# credential and must never be committed. .clasp.json is not secret (the script
# ID is visible in the editor URL) but it points at one specific person's Doc,
# so it stays local too; apps-script/README.md says how to recreate it.
.clasprc.json
**/.clasprc.json
apps-script/.clasp.json
